+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Section 3 (the minimum r-dominating subtree step before "
+        "Lemma 2, and Theorem 2) supplies a linear-time tree algorithm; at the "
+        "shipping preset n=1,200,007 with three radius encodings, the measured "
