+
+An additional independent audit exhaustively checked 100 small instances
+(25 seeds at each of 1–4 affine layers) against direct graph distances. Every
+planted set dominated directly and every instance had exactly one connected
+answer block.
+
+## Oracle loop and G9 diagnostics
+
